flowchart TD
  Need[Need a UI LWC bundle?] --> Q1{Folder name legal? lowercase start, no hyphen}
  Q1 -->|No my-widget| Rename[Rename to myWidget maps to c-my-widget]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Missing HTML, JS, or js-meta.xml?}
  Q2 -->|Missing HTML for UI| AddHtml[Add template file]
  Q2 -->|Missing JS| AddJs[Add class default export]
  Q2 -->|Not in App Builder| Q3{isExposed true and at least one target?}
  Q3 -->|No| Expose[Set isExposed and lightning__RecordPage or AppPage]
  Q3 -->|Parent CSS misses child h1| Scope[Style child as one element or use child :host — do not expect parent h1 to leak in]
